# Keep the build context small and keep data/weights OUT of the image (§2). Without this the
# ~1.9 GB of gitignored WMB data under vendors/*/data ships to the daemon on every build and
# bakes into the image. Corpora and ckpts mount at run time instead.
data/
**/data/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.bak
*.pt
.git/
results/
docs/
*.md
.env
